      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787148904950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- \u0022Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim\u0022 Yap\u0131lacaklar,",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- \u0022Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim\u0022 Yap\u0131lacaklar,",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LAO1PiRHv09kpd4iXOzAG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1519.0883885943704,
      "y": 411.88888888888886,
      "width": 758.902587890625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1070792098,
      "version": 67,
      "versionNonce": 799568802,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787148904950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- Oryantan Ko\u00E7u (Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim Listesi) \u0022E\u011Fitim Planlamas\u0131 Kaydedildi\u0022\ndurumunda, pop-up i\u00E7erisinde i\u015Flem yap\u0131lamaz olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Butonlar disable yap\u0131lmal\u0131\nveya gizlenmelidir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Oryantan Ko\u00E7u (Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim Listesi) \u0022E\u011Fitim Planlamas\u0131 Kaydedildi\u0022 durumunda, pop-up i\u00E7erisinde i\u015Flem yap\u0131lamaz olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Butonlar disable yap\u0131lmal\u0131 veya gizlenmelidir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RbL2mNkK8dVSGb4vmpoJr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1519.0883885943704,
      "y": 544.3888888888888,
      "width": 757.042724609375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 421438846,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 190689122,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787148904950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- Listede \u0022x saat\u0022 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilmelidir. Kolon Ad\u0131 (Saat) olmal\u0131, tablodaki sat\u0131rdan\nsaat yaz\u0131s\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca inputa say\u0131sal de\u011Fer girilmelidir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- Listede \u0022x saat\u0022 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilmelidir. Kolon Ad\u0131 (Saat) olmal\u0131, tablodaki sat\u0131rdan saat yaz\u0131s\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca inputa say\u0131sal de\u011Fer girilmelidir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mAbAWWD4rKbhgGQW_ESlG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1519.0883885943704,
      "y": 639.3888888888889,
      "width": 731.8794555664062,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 161937762,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 2088071970,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787148904951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3- Oryantan Ko\u00E7u (Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim Listesi), E\u011Fitim Planlama Listesinden\n\u0022zorunluMu\u0022: true olan kay\u0131tlarda d\u00FCzenleme butonu gizlenmelidir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3- Oryantan Ko\u00E7u (Oryantasyon E\u011Fitim Listesi), E\u011Fitim Planlama Listesinden \u0022zorunluMu\u0022: true olan kay\u0131tlarda d\u00FCzenleme butonu gizlenmelidir.",
